# Fasthosts

> Fasthosts Internet Ltd is a UK-based internet services provider founded in 1999 and headquartered in Gloucester, England. Part of the United Internet group, Fasthosts has served home users, home offices, and SMEs for over 25 years, offering hosting, domains, email, servers, website building, and AI infrastructure products. All infrastructure is UK-based, with data centres in Worcester and London.

